===Etymology===
{{inh|ru|sla-pro|*vъz-}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*uź-}}. Cognate with {{cog|lt|už||within, instead of, in return for}}, {{cog|lv|uz||on, to}}. Further etymology disputed. Compare also borrowed cognate {{m|ru|воз-}}, from {{etyl|cu|-}}.

